            "type": "text",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"TAC-676\",\"title\":\"i18n: base framework (i18next)\",\"description\":\"Stand up the i18n foundation for Genesis web so product surfaces can adopt translations incrementally.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* Choose and wire `i18next` + `react-i18next` (or equivalent) into `apps/web`\\n* Locale detection (browser / user preference) and persistence\\n* Language switcher (settings and/or chrome)\\n* Translation file layout + namespaces convention\\n* Type-safe keys / lint guardrails where practical\\n* Document how to add strings and locales for eng\\n\\n## Done when\\n\\n* A first locale can be selected and at least one shared string resolves via the framework\\n* Area tickets can land without reinventing setup\\n\\nParent: <issue id=\\\"5db4cac9-c534-477a-94bb-5bcdf3745405\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-675/add-internationalization-i18n-to-genesis\\\">TAC-675</issue>\",\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-676/i18n-base-framework-i18next\",\"gitBranchName\":\"tac-676-i18n-base-framework-i18next\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-17T20:46:27.645Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-22T16:19:17.445Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-22T16:05:17.966Z\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-21T15:47:01.233Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Done\",\"statusType\":\"completed\",\"labels\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"4afd648d-b4d3-40c9-9580-c72105b177d0\",\"title\":\"feat(web): i18n foundation with en and pt-BR (TAC-676, TAC-677)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/agentuity/genesis-mono/pull/759\"}],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"ca21725b-1da0-47f6-a428-c5af7ea240a7\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-17T20:46:27.645Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-07-21T15:47:01.745Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"1e2bfcca-1326-4677-aae3-6a59bd8a86