            "text": "{\"id\":\"TAC-679\",\"title\":\"i18n: collections\",\"description\":\"Internationalize Collections — list, builder, record views, settings, chat-in-collection, and help copy.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* `/collections` and collection detail/settings routes\\n* Collection builder / schema / history / help\\n* Collection session chrome strings\\n\\nDepends on: <issue id=\\\"6b9fb302-6316-4470-ab52-5dfec691c6e0\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-676/i18n-base-framework-i18next\\\">TAC-676</issue>\\nParent: <issue id=\\\"5db4cac9-c534-477a-94bb-5bcdf3745405\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-675/add-internationalization-i18n-to-genesis\\\">TAC-675</issue>\",\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-679/i18n-collections\",\"gitBranchName\":\"tac-679-i18n-collections\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-17T20:46:38.786Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:09:21.699Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:09:21.679Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"ca21725b-1da0-47f6-a428-c5af7ea240a7\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-17T20:46:38.786Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-07-21T15:47:15.082Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"0e53370a-3a01-4214-9108-ed65bf40e5d9\",\"name\":\"Todo\",\"type\":\"unstarted\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-21T15:47:15.082Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:09:21.694Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"1e2bfcca-1326-4677-aae3-6a59bd8a86fc\",\"name\":\"In Progress\",\"type\":\"started\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:09:21.694Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\",\"createdById\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"assignee\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\",\"assigneeId\":\"da28c5da-c96f-