            "text": "{\"id\":\"TAC-685\",\"title\":\"i18n: presentations, ads, files & misc pages\",\"description\":\"Internationalize secondary product surfaces: Presentations, Ads, Files, Agents, Help, Release notes, and Share pages.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* `/presentations`, `/ads`, `/files`, `/agents`\\n* `/help`, `/release`, `/share`\\n* Related list/detail/workspace chrome\\n\\nDepends on: <issue id=\\\"6b9fb302-6316-4470-ab52-5dfec691c6e0\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-676/i18n-base-framework-i18next\\\">TAC-676</issue>\\nParent: <issue id=\\\"5db4cac9-c534-477a-94bb-5bcdf3745405\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-675/add-internationalization-i18n-to-genesis\\\">TAC-675</issue>\",\"priority\":{\"value\":4,\"name\":\"Low\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-685/i18n-presentations-ads-files-and-misc-pages\",\"gitBranchName\":\"tac-685-i18n-presentations-ads-files-misc-pages\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-17T20:46:58.616Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:08:34.117Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Todo\",\"statusType\":\"unstarted\",\"labels\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"ca21725b-1da0-47f6-a428-c5af7ea240a7\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-17T20:46:58.616Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-07-21T15:47:20.331Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"0e53370a-3a01-4214-9108-ed65bf40e5d9\",\"name\":\"Todo\",\"type\":\"unstarted\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-21T15:47:20.331Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\",\"createdById\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"assignee\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\",\"assigneeId\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"project\":\"Genesis\",\"projectId\":\"4e08de05-a9c6-4111-91f8-809f8683ec38\",\"parentId\":\"TAC-675\",\"team\":\"The Agent Com