            "type": "text",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"TAC-686\",\"title\":\"i18n: main website\",\"description\":\"Internationalize the main public website (VitePress docs / marketing site under `docs/`).\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* VitePress locale / i18n setup for the public site\\n* Translate primary marketing and product pages\\n* Language switcher / locale routing for the site\\n* Align locale list and conventions with the product app where practical\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\nCan proceed in parallel with app area tickets once locale/content conventions are agreed; prefer matching the locale set from the app framework ticket.\\n\\nParent: <issue id=\\\"5db4cac9-c534-477a-94bb-5bcdf3745405\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-675/add-internationalization-i18n-to-genesis\\\">TAC-675</issue>\",\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-686/i18n-main-website\",\"gitBranchName\":\"tac-686-i18n-main-website\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-17T20:47:00.759Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:00:31.253Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:00:31.235Z\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-31T21:45:07.266Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Done\",\"statusType\":\"completed\",\"labels\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"ca21725b-1da0-47f6-a428-c5af7ea240a7\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-17T20:47:00.759Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-07-21T15:47:21.598Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"0e53370a-3a01-4214-9108-ed65bf40e5d9\",\"name\":\"Todo\",\"type\":\"unstarted\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-21T15:47:21.598Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-07-31T21:45:07.295Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"1e2bfcca-1326-4677-aae3-6a59bd8a86fc\",\"name\":\"In Progress\",\"type\":\"started\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-31T21:45:07.295Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-07-31T22:00:31.246Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"e6ea5814-c7e8-4a77-